          "Do you prefer full contact sports or non-contact sports?",
          "Would your parents allow you to take part in full contact sports?",
          "Would you participate in a full contact sport?",
          "Have you ever been injured playing sport?",
          "Do you think it is okay for girls to play full contact sports?",
          "Do you think full contact sports should be banned?",
          "Do you think full contact sports will ever be widely accepted in Hong Kong?"
