          "Which is your least favourite subject?",
          "Are you happy with the courses offered in your school?",
          "In your experience, are core subjects easier than electives?",
          "What criteria do you consider before choosing an elective?",
          "What are the pros and cons of requiring students to take core subjects?",
          "Which elective do you think should be made into a compulsory subject?",
          "Have electives made your learning experience more well-rounded?"
