          "Do you think the concept of a standing restaurant would work in Hong Kong?",
          "Do you think it is better to sit or stand at a music concert?",
          "Do you think it is a good idea that people stand up in meetings at work?",
          "Do you agree that your concentration would not be affected if you were working at a standing desk?"
