        "Would you enjoy learning English through video games?",
        "Is it important for teachers to make English lessons fun?",
        "Can video games be used to teach other subjects?",
        "Would teachers who use video games to teach English be popular?",
        "How effective is the use of technology in teaching English?",
        "Do you think that a student’s English proficiency would improve through the use of songs?",
        "Apart from using video games, what else can teachers do to enhance students’ interest in learning English?",
        "Do you think it’s important to have a balance between work and play in the classroom?"
