        "Do you think robots could do any useful work in your secondary school?",
        "In a restaurant, would you rather be served by a robot or a real person?",
        "If you had a robot, what would you like it to do?",
        "Do you think it is worth spending fifty thousand dollars on a restaurant robot?"
